      ],
      "event_ids": [
        "569555/becf0e528e129e04/E01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "point": "Even if acquiescence were proved, it would not defeat the statutory right to eject for an originally unauthorized subletting.",
      "refs": [
        "IK-569555:L306",
